  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SUPPORT TO OIL TRANSPARENCY AND GREATER BUDGET ACCOUNTABILITY IN NIGER DELTA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The global objective of the specific contract is to support Public Finance management reforms around transparency and accountability through the lens of the Open Government Partnership commitments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specific objective(s) &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The specific contract has the following three specific objectives:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-&lt;strong&gt;Assignment 1: &lt;/strong&gt;To improve extractive sector transparency by supporting NEITI efforts around contract disclosure, the implementation of the PIA as well as the ability to analyse contract to assess inflows to the host community trust funds. This contributes to OGP&#xbf;s &lt;strong&gt;commitments 4&lt;/strong&gt; and 5.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-&lt;strong&gt;Assignment 2:&lt;/strong&gt;To improve evidence for effective participation and opportunities for technology based solutions to increase CSOs demand for transparency and accountability in the specific case of the Niger delta region. This contributes to OGP&#xbf;s &lt;strong&gt;commitments 1 and 11&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-&lt;strong&gt;Assignment 3:&lt;/strong&gt; To identify areas of support and focus for the Delegation in terms of fast tracking the OGP agenda as well as PFM reforms in the Niger Delta region.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
